{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"23690","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/23690","key":"MC-278733","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"06/Dec/24 12:27 PM","customfield_10050":"1341113","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h4><a name=\"WhatIexpectedtohappenwas...%3A\"></a>What I expected to happen was...:</h4>\n\n<p>When breaking a double resin slab block with any level of pickaxe 2 slab items should have appeared</p>\n\n<h4><a name=\"Whatactuallyhappenedwas...%3A\"></a>What actually happened was...:</h4>\n<p>When breaking the double slab block only one slab item appeared </p>\n\n<h4><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a>Steps to Reproduce:</h4>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Place down two resin slabs on top of one another to make a full block</li>\n\t<li>Using any level of pick, break the block and only one appears instead of 2</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4><a name=\"Codeanalysis%28officialmappings%29\"></a>Code analysis (official mappings)</h4>\n<p>In the <tt>VanillaBlockLoot#generate</tt> method: </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\"><span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.dropSelf(Blocks.RESIN_BRICK_SLAB);</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> instead of </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\"><span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.add(Blocks.RESIN_BRICK_SLAB, $$1x -&gt; <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.createSlabItemTable($$1x));</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<h4><a name=\"Codeanalysis%28Yarnmappings%29\"></a>Code analysis (Yarn mappings)</h4>\n\n<p>In the <tt>VanillaBlockLootTableGenerator#generate</tt> method:</p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\"><span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.addDrop(Blocks.RESIN_BRICK_SLAB);\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>instead of</p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\"><span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.addDrop(Blocks.RESIN_BRICK_SLAB, block -&gt; <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.slabDrops(block));\n</pre>\n</div></div>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"06/Dec/24 8:33 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"11/Dec/24 2:13 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"26/Apr/25 5:41 PM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Breaking a double resin brick slab block only returns a single slab","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-278733/watchers","watchCount":1,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2024-12-06T12:27:18.622-0800","customfield_10050":"1341113","customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10095","value":"Expansion A","id":"10095"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I expected to happen was...:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When breaking a double resin slab block with any level of pickaxe 2 slab items should have appeared"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"What actually happene